  "body": "In all of the predictors, the calculation of the root (x) is conducted using a recurrence relation that is iterated 10 times. In some circumstances, this is more iterations than is required, and in other circumstances 10 iterations isn't adequate.\r\n\r\nIt would be better to iterate the recurrence relation until the value stabilizes.\r\n\r\nWe know that x is in the interval [1,1/p] which is a subset of [1,k], and the sequence is monotonic up (so ``x >= x_last``), so we don't need much fanciness for looking for \"equality\" in this case.\r\n",
